To retrieve a list of payment methods for a customer:

```ts
const [paymentMethods, count] =
  await paymentModuleService.listAndCountPaymentMethods({
    provider_id: "pp_stripe_stripe",
    context: {
      customer: {
        id: "cus_123",
        metadata: {
          pp_stripe_stripe_customer_id: "str_1234"
        }
      },
    },
  })
```
